      "title": "Facts and statements",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "Callaghan and Müller-Hansen formulate stopping as rejecting a null hypothesis that achieved recall is below a chosen target. (low confidence)",
          "source": "https://link.springer.com/article/10.1186/s13643-020-01521-4",
          "note": null,
