          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Their random-sampling criterion uses a hypergeometric model for relevant records drawn without replacement from the finite unscreened pool. (low confidence)",
          "source": "https://link.springer.com/article/10.1186/s13643-020-01521-4",
          "note": null,
          "claimId": "clm:3e5b0c498376985aca732b4163130ca175a61e79d9fa64c9f4442ca4ea9211d6",
